{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d910fbc1-d6f6-8ad9-a1bd-1fb07deed510",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T12:38:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:36:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. There's a pothole on my street that's deep enough to swallow a tire, and I'd like it added to the repair list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, we can do that. Where's the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "318 Washington Street, in the Point. The hole is right in front of the house, near the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:36:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 318 Washington. And you said it's deep. Any idea how big across?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:36:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two feet across. With the rain coming down today it's filling with water, so it's hard to see. A car is going to drop right into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the problem with the puddles, people can't tell how deep they are. Let me write this down. Large pothole, two feet across, front of 318 Washington, filling with water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:37:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Sorry, I'm on speakerphone. [pause] I'm in the kitchen and they're painting the next room, so I can smell the fresh paint. I didn't want to hold the phone near it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:37:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Fresh paint, that'll get you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. One more question. If someone hits that hole and damages the car, does the city reimburse for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a claim process for vehicle damage. I don't handle it here. That goes through the city clerk's office, and they'd decide on it. I can transfer you over, or give you the department to ask for."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just tell me who to ask for. I haven't hit it, I only want to know where I'd go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:37:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call back and ask for the city clerk's office and say you want to know about a damage claim. Meanwhile I'll get this in the system so a crew can look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:38:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. When would they get to it, roughly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:38:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "With the storm today and into tomorrow, patching won't happen while it's wet. Probably after it dries out, sometime next week if the weather cooperates."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:38:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Do you need a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead, in case dispatch wants to confirm the spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:38:28-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175, Mr. Patel. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kevin. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Stay dry out there."
    }
  ],
